  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AncientNotePickup
  noteId: ancient_note_floating_tree_02
  interactionRange: 2.8
  floatingTreeClue: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 58c7a20fb69943318fe59099bdafd046, type: 3}
  tyrantMapClue: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b78b91cd33564c2fba3584e928f66a46, type: 3}
  noteUiPrefab: {fileID: 5381400642266364740, guid: 5088545c969c4ae988055540d010d380, type: 3}
  note2Title: THE WHISPER BENEATH THE ROOTS
  note2Subtitle: "L\u1EDCI TH\xCC TH\u1EA6M D\u01AF\u1EDAI NH\u1EEENG B\u1ED8 R\u1EC4"
  note2MessageEnglish: "To the one who has found this place,\n\nIf you are reading
    these words, then I may no longer have the chance to finish the path ahead myself.\n\nI
    once believed the beast within this forest was the cause of the chaos that consumed
    this island.\n\nI was wrong.\n\nIt, too, was only a victim.\n\nA guardian twisted
    by a power that has been spreading silently beneath this island.\n\nI have left
    a map beneath the roots of this tree. Upon it lies the path I was never able
    to finish.\n\nTake it with you.\n\nFollow the forgotten mark upon the map, and
    continue where I could not.\n\nAt the end of that path, you will find the truth
    \u2014 and perhaps the one responsible for all the suffering we have endured.\n\nIf
    you truly wish to bring peace back to this island, you will have to face him.\n\nI
    ask only one thing of you...\n\nDo not let the sacrifices of those who fell here
    become meaningless.\n\nAnd be careful.\n\nSomething is still watching every step
    you take."
  note2MessageVietnamese: "G\u1EEDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 t\xECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    \u0111\u1EBFn n\u01A1i n\xE0y,\n\nN\u1EBFu ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111ang \u0111\u1ECDc
    nh\u1EEFng d\xF2ng n\xE0y, c\xF3 l\u1EBD ta \u0111\xE3 kh\xF4ng c\xF2n c\u01A1
    h\u1ED9i \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 m\xECnh ho\xE0n th\xE0nh con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
    ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc.\n\nTa t\u1EEBng ngh\u0129 con qu\xE1i v\u1EADt trong
    khu r\u1EEBng n\xE0y l\xE0 nguy\xEAn nh\xE2n khi\u1EBFn h\xF2n \u0111\u1EA3o
    r\u01A1i v\xE0o h\u1ED7n lo\u1EA1n. Nh\u01B0ng ta \u0111\xE3 l\u1EA7m.\n\nN\xF3
    c\u0169ng ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t n\u1EA1n nh\xE2n.\n\nM\u1ED9t k\u1EBB canh
    gi\u1EEF b\u1ECB bi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED5i b\u1EDFi th\u1EE9 s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh
    \u0111ang \xE2m th\u1EA7m lan r\u1ED9ng b\xEAn d\u01B0\u1EDBi h\xF2n \u0111\u1EA3o.\n\nTa
    \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t t\u1EA5m b\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3 d\u01B0\u1EDBi
    nh\u1EEFng b\u1ED9 r\u1EC5 c\u1EE7a c\xE1i c\xE2y n\xE0y. Tr\xEAn \u0111\xF3
    l\xE0 con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng m\xE0 ta \u0111\xE3 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111i
    h\u1EBFt.\n\nH\xE3y mang n\xF3 theo.\n\nH\xE3y l\u1EA7n theo d\u1EA5u \u1EA5n
    tr\xEAn b\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3 v\xE0 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c thay ph\u1EA7n c\u1EE7a
    ta.\n\n\u1EDE cu\u1ED1i con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng \u1EA5y, ng\u01B0\u01A1i s\u1EBD
    t\xECm th\u1EA5y s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt \u2014 v\xE0 c\xF3 l\u1EBD c\u1EA3 k\u1EBB
    \u0111\xE3 khi\u1EBFn t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 ch\xFAng ta ph\u1EA3i ch\u1ECBu \u0111\u1EF1ng
    \u0111\u1EBFn ng\xE0y h\xF4m nay.\n\nN\u1EBFu ng\u01B0\u01A1i th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1
    mu\u1ED1n mang s\u1EF1 b\xECnh y\xEAn tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i h\xF2n \u0111\u1EA3o
    n\xE0y, ng\u01B0\u01A1i s\u1EBD ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1ED1i m\u1EB7t v\u1EDBi h\u1EAFn.\n\nTa
    ch\u1EC9 xin ng\u01B0\u01A1i m\u1ED9t \u0111i\u1EC1u...\n\n\u0110\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EC3
    s\u1EF1 hy sinh c\u1EE7a nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 n\u1EB1m l\u1EA1i
    n\u01A1i \u0111\xE2y tr\u1EDF n\xEAn v\xF4 ngh\u0129a.\n\nV\xE0 h\xE3y c\u1EA9n
    th\u1EADn.\n\nC\xF3 th\u1EE9 g\xEC \u0111\xF3 v\u1EABn \u0111ang d\xF5i theo
    t\u1EEBng b\u01B0\u1EDBc ch\xE2n c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
